{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415669","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415669","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041566901:1":{"text":"이 곤봉, 낡은 것 같아.","source_cn":"这根棍子有点旧了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC917182A78692CCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566902:1":{"text":"어디 보자... 확실히 끝이 좀 닳았소. 힘을 주면 부러질 듯하오.","source_cn":"我看看……确实，顶端磨损得有些厉害，这里再用力就会断了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DD0F73C9A1B8737","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566903:1":{"text":"직접 깎은 것이오?","source_cn":"这是你自己处理的木棍吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA5433A9FF2C41D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566904:1":{"text":"맞아. 손에 맞는 걸 주워서 대충 깎아서 쓰고 있어.","source_cn":"嗯，恰好捡了一根顺手的，打磨了下就直接用了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC79FFFCB7505854","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566905:1":{"text":"사막의 나무는 섬유질이 적고 건조해서 쉽게 갈라지오.","source_cn":"沙漠里的树，木质普遍疏松些，加上气候干燥，韧性就差点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0D970D481E63AB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566906:1":{"text":"윤활유를 나눠 드리리다. 다음에 나뭇가지를 줍거든 소인의 말대로 해보시지요. 훨씬 튼튼할 것이오.","source_cn":"我分你一些保养油，你再捡到木棍，照我说的预处理一次，就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0316B38A212BD0D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566907:1":{"text":"너의... 곤봉, 네 손에 딱 맞는 것 같군.","source_cn":"你用的这根……木棍，看起来就很顺手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CF022933F40E52D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566908:1":{"text":"이건 대나무이오. 소인의 고향에서는 흔한 식물이고, 여기도 조금씩 심고 있소이다.","source_cn":"这是竹子，我故乡常见的植物，如今在这边也有种植了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDFC2B322CEB8390","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566909:1":{"text":"조건만 맞으면 금세 자라고 쉽게 구할 수 있다는 장점이 있으나, 그 조건에 맞는 곳을 찾기가 어렵다는 단점이 있소이다.","source_cn":"优点是只要找到合适的地方，那它长得快又易得，缺点就是很...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB76E2B79B4DE314","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566910:1":{"text":"한 번 써보시겠소? 속이 비어 있으니 평소 쓰는 것과는 무게 중심이 사뭇 다를 것이오.","source_cn":"你要试试吗？它是中空的，和你平时用的重心不同。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC7856E634411D4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041566911:1":{"text":"어디 보자... 아, 느낌이 특이하네.","source_cn":"我试试……嗯，很特别的手感。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC1FB09F3C58877C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041566912:1":{"text":"이는 소인의 키와 손에 맞추어 깎은 것이니, 그 길이와 두께가 그대에겐 맞지 않을 것이오.","source_cn":"这根是我按自己的身高和握持方式打磨的，长度和粗细都不适合你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD964E85279CA31C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041566913:1":{"text":"다음에 올 적엔 그대에게 맞는 것을 하나 가져다 주겠소이다.","source_cn":"下次我过来，给你带一根适合你的吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16C4894D817793CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041566914:1":{"text":"고마워. 그럼 사양하지 않겠어.","source_cn":"多谢，我就不客气了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC0A3F43D656AB47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:潘":{"text":"판","source":"潘","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":2}}